    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "common_0070_rival_02",
      "hash64": "FA14B18685E997C8",
      "text": "果然是这样啊！\\n你是对面那家的，我们是邻居！[VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "common_0070_rival_03",
      "hash64": "FA14B28685E9997B",
      "text": "我一直超～好奇\\n新搬来的邻居是什么样的人呢。[VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "common_0070_rival_04",
      "hash64": "FA14B78685E9A1FA",
      "text": "我叫妮莫！\\n平时住在学校的宿舍。\\r\\n既然我们是邻居，就互相关照一下吧！[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
